---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<footer class="bg-[#2F2F2F] text-white pt-12 pb-20 md:pb-12 border-t border-[#D4A33D]/30 font-sans">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-10">
            <!-- Brand -->
            <div class="space-y-4 md:col-span-1">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <img src="/docs/brand/Logo AnaFerreira_w.png" alt="Ana Ferreira" class="h-8 w-auto" />
                    <span class="font-heading font-bold text-lg tracking-wider text-white">ANA FERREIRA</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-light">
                    Sua essência, sua assinatura. Elegância, beleza e bem-estar com perfumaria fina e cuidados diários.
                </p>
                <div class="text-xs text-[#D4A33D] font-medium">
                    Provérbios 16:3
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Links -->
            <div>
                <h4 class="font-heading text-sm font-semibold text-[#D4A33D] uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Catálogo</h4>
                <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-white/80">
                    <li><a href="/category/femininos" class="hover:text-[#D4A33D] transition-colors">Perfumes Femininos</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/category/masculinos" class="hover:text-[#D4A33D] transition-colors">Perfumes Masculinos</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/category/cosmeticos" class="hover:text-[#D4A33D] transition-colors">Body Splash & Hidratantes</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/category/todos" class="hover:text-[#D4A33D] transition-colors">Ver Todos</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Ajuda -->
            <div>
                <h4 class="font-heading text-sm font-semibold text-[#D4A33D] uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Informações</h4>
                <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-white/80">
                    <li><a href="/blog" class="hover:text-[#D4A33D] transition-colors">Blog da Perfumaria</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-[#D4A33D] transition-colors">Sobre a Marca</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/contact" class="hover:text-[#D4A33D] transition-colors">Fale Conosco</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Contato -->
            <div>
                <h4 class="font-heading text-sm font-semibold text-[#D4A33D] uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Atendimento</h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-white/80 mb-2">WhatsApp: (84) 9.9422-4545</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-white/80 mb-2">Instagram: @lojagratidaoshop</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-white/80">Shopee: annaferreira81</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-center text-xs text-white/50">
            © 2026 Ana Ferreira Perfumes / Loja Gratidão Shop. Todos os direitos reservados.
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
